### Preview Client report input
POST http://localhost:3000/admin/reports/client/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filters": {
    "latestSaveFrom": "2020-01-01",
    "latestSaveTo": "2020-01-31"
  }
}

### Run Stage 1 Client report
POST http://localhost:3000/admin/reports/client/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Summarize clients changed in the selected period. Show totals by clientType and a short table of recent clients.",
  "filters": {
    "latestSaveFrom": "2026-01-01",
    "latestSaveTo": "2026-01-31"
  },
  "options": {
    "limit": 200,
    "includeRawRows": false
  }
}

### List recent Client report executions
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/reports/client/executions

### Get one Client report execution by id
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/reports/client/executions/REPLACE_WITH_EXECUTION_ID
